 type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game configs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game mode can be configured individually to make every match feel unique. Combine different settings to make the game your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.poster.avif?t=1759262409\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.webm?t=1759262409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.mp4?t=1759262409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Turtlecode Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/b2501356c08d46052a78a359f70a44fe49b2fedd/header.jpg?t=1759262409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2883690/331334664/668eb328adcba22e1a6e81f60ae1331d4a15172c/1759219884/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759262406","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2883690/331334664/668eb328adcba22e1a6e81f60ae1331d4a15172c/1759219884/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759262406","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2883690/331334664/668eb328adcba22e1a6e81f60ae1331d4a15172c/1759219884/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759262406","id":257199769,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199769/movie480.mp4?t=1759262406","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199769/movie_max.mp4?t=1759262406"},"name"